    {
      "section": "5.4.2.4",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9033]",
      "text": "ESW shall provide visualization UIs or tools that support the following applications:\n� Target acquisition support (acquisition and WFS)\n� Science data quick-look data quality assurance support\n� Technical data presentation\n� Environmental conditions presentation\n� System status presentation",
      "id": "REQ-1-OAD-9033"
    },
    {
      "section": "5.4.2.5",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9358]",
      "text": "The ESW ACQ shall provide extendable and customizable high-level sequences that integrate all observatory subsystems to enable and implement first-light target and data acquisition.",
