    },
    {
      "section": "5.4.2.5",
      "label": "[REQ-OAD-9348]",
      "text": "ESW ACQ shall provide support for gathering and logging information for basic observing-oriented metrics including: total amount of science and non-science observing time, open shutter efficiency, target acquisition statistics, Target of Opportunity observations.",
