      "id": "REQ-1-OAD-9362"
    },
    {
      "section": "5.4.3",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9820]",
      "text": "The DMS shall support the continuous and peak science data throughput estimates of Appendix A.3 of the OpsRD (RD35).",
      "id": "REQ-1-OAD-9820"
    },
    {
      "section": "5.4.3",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9364]",
      "text": "The DMS shall provide infrastructure that allows data production from science instruments and other data sources (e.g., wavefront sensors) to integrate with the ESW.",
      "id": "REQ-1-OAD-9364"
    },
    {
      "section": "5.4.3",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9366]",
      "text": "The DMS shall provide infrastructure to capture, store and associate science data metadata during science data acquisition.",
