      "section": "5.4.3.2",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9370]",
      "text": "The storage system shall have the ability to increase its capacity as needed over the lifetime of the observatory if no offsite archive is created or the most recent 2 years if there is an offsite archive.",
